  "description": "API probe (R10): project.reload_mesh of grid2x2 to grid4x2, then of a file that does not exist; the ReloadMeshStatus given to the callback, the events around it, the texture sets and layer stack after each reload, in both recordings, with the BaseColor export.",
  "inputs": [
    {
      "input_id": "grid2x2",
      "kind": "mesh",
      "path": "parity/fixtures/tier0-semantics/meshes/grid2x2.obj",
